'''Kano & Souma''' are a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 8.6 Update|Version 8.6]] and can be unlocked when beating any stage in [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event#The World Beyond|The World Beyond]] during the [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 483
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Kano & Souma
|name2 = Kano & Souma & Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Kano & Souma & Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Although this unit appears to be a superior equivalent to specialist meatshields like [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]], it is ultimately outclassed due to various issues, since its very awkward price range doesn't provide any value. It lacks Immunity to status effects like Warp/Slow, which are commonly used by many Alien threats. Despite having high effective health and speed, its additional knockback effectively negates this advantage by reducing the amount of damage it could potentially absorb, not to mention slower units often are better as they can create a thick line of defense. And while it can be boosted by Catseyes to increase its stats to see use, especially in restriction stages, it is again outclassed by more accessible alternatives.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

